{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17548","headline":"荅权载之离合诗 · 许孟容","name":"荅权载之离合诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"史才司秘府，文哲今超古。\n亦有擅风骚，六联文墨曹。\n圣贤三代意，工艺千金字。\n化识从臣谣，人推仙阁吏。\n如登崑阆时，口诵灵真词。\n孙简下威凤，系霜琼玉枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许孟容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}